        <span itemprop="subject">the porous film</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">preferably has a thickness of 4 to 40  ⁇ m, more preferably 7 to 30  ⁇ m, in a case where (i) a porous film is used as a base material and (ii) a porous layer is deposited on one or both surfaces of the porous film to produce a laminated body.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0117">
